  "prefLabel": "Rev 401.15 Municipal assessing officials",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 401.15 “Municipal assessing officials” means the:\n\n(a) Governing body of a municipality;\n\n(b) Assessors of a municipality; or\n\n(c) County commissioners of an unincorporated place.\n\nSource. #12027, eff 10-28-16; renumbered by #12925 (formerly Rev 401.14)",
